  "question": {
    "text": "The variation of refractive index of a crown glass thin prism with wavelength of the incident light is shown. Which of the following graphs is the correct one, if $D_{m}$ is the angle of minimum deviation?\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/BD73f_Y3SKAxOzuwCxcEQiZ8L-l4R4U0R-0cyAZvvG8.original.fullsize.png\">",
